  "description": "Surgewave Disaggregated Storage — pure types and validation for the disaggregated-wal (AutoMQ-style) and disaggregated-stateless (WarpStream-style) topic modes. Hosts the StorageMode enum, the StreamObjectRef / PartitionManifest records, and the topic-config validator. The actual write paths live in the per-mode engine projects (P2, P3 in ADR-014).",
